---
import Demo from "../../layouts/Demo.astro";
import Harbour from "../../components/harbour/Harbour.astro";
---
<Demo title="The harbour" description="Victoria Harbour, drawn from data. Every building, window, beam and ripple is a number.">
  <Fragment slot="instructions">Hover over the city to read it, or focus the picture and use <kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd>. The badge in the corner says whether the water shows the live order book or a snapshot.</Fragment>
  <Harbour />
  <Fragment slot="source">
    <strong>Data:</strong> Binance public market data. The skyline uses BTC/USDT daily closes from 2020. The water uses the live <code>btcusdt@depth20@100ms</code> stream; if that is blocked, it falls back to a REST snapshot from <code>data-api.binance.vision</code>, and failing that to a snapshot bundled with this site (taken 5 Oct 2026). The beams show the QTS data platform's race test. The browser connects to Binance directly; no key, no server.
  </Fragment>
</Demo>
